OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FOutbreaks of showery rain at
OL,6,Ffirst, perhaps heavy in places, and
OL,7,Fsome drier intervals. Perhaps briefly
OL,8,Fbecoming drier more widely around
OL,9,Fmidday. Further heavy showers and
OL,10,Fthunderstorms then developing through
OL,11,Fthe afternoon with a risk of hail.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers and thunderstorms
OL,14,Fcontinue during the evening, before
OL,15,Feasing into Monday. Staying rather
OL,16,Fcloudy, with hill fog across the
OL,17,FPennines. A few showers remain
OL,18,Fpossible by dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
