OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F166A1788067146
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G2/2
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FEarly cloud breaks, with sunny
OL,6,Fspells but also a few showers
OL,7,Fdeveloping, the odd one perhaps heavy
OL,8,Fand thundery. These easing through the
OL,9,Fafternoon, but turning rather cloudy
OL,10,Fand breezy.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FMostly
OL,13,Fdry Tuesday, although a few showers
OL,14,Faround. Rather windy Wednesday, with
OL,15,Foutbreaks of rain, occasionally heavy.
OL,16,FLikely drier Thursday, but still
OL,17,Fwindy. Daytime temperatures near
OL,18,Fnormal, but warm overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
